# The launcher writes nothing into the repo AT RUNTIME. The machine-specific config is
# ~/.config/launchers-launcher/config.json, logs + sidecar files live under ~/.local/share/
# (see README "Local state"). This list only catches developer / accidental junk.

# dependencies
node_modules/

# logs (the launcher writes to ~/.local/share/; this only guards against a stray .log in the repo)
*.log

# local env / secrets
.env

# editor / OS
*~
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Old machine-specific root JSONs: lib/config.js migrateFromLegacy() copies their content ONCE
# into ~/.config/launchers-launcher/config.json, after that they are no longer read (the old files
# are NOT deleted). They do not exist in a fresh clone; this only covers leftovers on a dev machine.
launcher-order.json
launchers-custom.json
display-config.json
theme-config.json

# Claude Code local settings (machine-specific permissions)
.claude/
